<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature è referenziata solo come membro dell'unione che costituisce il range originale di R12 has referred to entity e R13 has referring entity, e il domain delle loro inverse; non è istanziata nel corpus DeSMòS."@it .
<https://w3id.org/lso/intro/beta202506#INT2_ActualizationOfFeature> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, INT2 Actualization of Feature is referenced only as a member of the original union range of R12 has referred to entity and R13 has referring entity, and of the union domain of their inverses; it is not instantiated in the DeSMòS corpus."@en .
